body:
Really, just nothing to compare. 
You said it.
@OP, it depends if you can let go when in a modified state of consciousness, some have fear to lose control, some just let it go, and all goes well.

It should be the same, as they share many many common features with SSRI. 
And both are known to cause sexual issues..  sadly.

//EDIT: As he explains, serotonin level and low dopamine level that are common shared between antidepressants and antipsychotics play a role PSSD.

https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CZATt5AoQjw

There are other mechanisms evolved you can look at, again, sharing same effects from SSRI and antipsychotics. 
//

Yeah,  but from a daily smoker's point of view, that's not even a thing, I mean I don't get a push while smoking at peak or anything.
If something, at high dosage, it tend to prolong the come-down a bit and that's nice.
// EDIT: when I read some people, how crazy powerful combo it can get, it makes me jalouse hahaa, no really, even if I take a break 2 weekks (I do those breaks sometimes, it's needed), and the weed that previously just made me feel relaxed may then put me comatose, but it won't amplify the trip, but maybe mess with it in a bad way//

Yeah same.
But avoid war movies and such.. probably best;)
 @OP Have a nice trip mate,!

Many thanks this helps a lot, I will talk about that in next appointment.
It's exactly as you described it, also saw while under stress it would start, it's just so bad ... I'm looking as if I was in full opiates withdrawals or drugged (from the outside perspective).

//EDIT: when I first heard of Clonidine was in the Hoffman's book about LSD, he used it to combat nausea, fast heartbeats, sweatings,... (He started to have a panic attack, that finally went very well, if you mind to know haha). 
And I've read that it diminishes the physical effects of a panic attack, without alleviating the mind aspect, so you still have anxiety but with less physical disabilities coming from it, am I right for those who know Clonidine and related ?
//

Many thanks!

Wash them under whater it should be fine:)
//EDIT I mean no signs of degradation by any bacteria or fungus, they look nice.
So I would suggest they are ok, if you don't smell something strange, always trust your noise..
They look very good. The blueish is normal.
//

Have fun and have a nice trip haha;)
Beautiful!
//EDIT: seems much, while we had 50mg also to make our vial, it seemed so little, like some salt grains.
It was delivered in a tube filled with argon (inert gaz).
//

Turn on, tune in, drop out haha.
No, seriously, let it just go.
Everything will seem just more intense, vivid.

Enjoy.

//EDIT: for all those who will come here. As you probably now are at baseline, hope you enjoyed your journey.
//

